<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Warburton becomes chairman of Gibson.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Warburton becomes chairman of Gibson.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gibson Chemical Industries Ltd said Dick Warburton had been appointed chairman following the retirement last week of Frank Lawson.</p>
<p>Warburton is a member of the Reserve Bank of Australia board and a former chief of Du Pont Australia.</p>
<p>He is chairman also of Sydney Harbour Casino Holdings Ltd and retailer David Jones Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
